{
  "id": "allen-heath.qu24",
  "maker": "Allen & Heath",
  "model": "Qu-24",
  "category": "mixer",
  "summary": "A 24-channel digital mixing console with motorised faders, onboard processing, and a 32x32 USB audio interface. The full desk carries 24 mono mic/line inputs and three stereo inputs; this entry sketches the first four mic channels and models the routing and interface connections in full. Drawn as a desk: the control surface is the top, the sockets are on the rear, and the front is the lip below the faders. All twenty-four channel faders move, as does the master. The entry still describes four of its twenty-four input sockets, which is a different claim: a fader you can move is not an assertion about what is plugged in.",
